    "HTTP 明文连接下，API Key 与服务器数据可能被同一网络内的攻击者窃听或篡改。建议为面板配置 HTTPS 后再用 https:// 地址连接。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Over a plain HTTP connection, the API key and server data can be intercepted or tampered with by attackers on the same network. Set up HTTPS for the panel and connect via https:// instead."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HTTP 明文连接：API Key 与数据可能被链路窃听，建议改用 https://" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Plain HTTP connection: the API key and data can be intercepted in transit. Prefer https://"
          }
        }
      }
    },
